{
  "description": "This protocol performs a specific set of genealogy dilutions and transferred to and from 96 deepwell plates and 1.5ml, 15ml, and 50ml. Input for the protocol should be specified in a .csv file as shown in this template.\n\n\n\nP300 and P1000 single-channel GEN2 electronic pipettes\nOpentrons 300ul and 1000ul tiprack\nOpentrons 4-in-1 tuberack sets with  NEST 1.5ml snapcap, 15ml, and 50ml tubes\nNEST 96 Deepwell Plate 2mL #503001",
